'''kONO.ECF''' (previously known as '''TBA.ECF''') is a [[:category:Ukraine|Ukrainian]] esports organization founded by Ukrainian professional footballer [[:wikipedia:Yevhen Konoplyanka|Yevhen Konoplyanka]].

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3

|content1=
* March 16th - The core of [[ex-ENEIDA]], consisting of [[byr9]], [[s4ltovsk1yy]], [[kensizor]], [[Polbandana]] and [[amster]], are signed by a yet to be announced organization, temporarily playing under the tag '''TBA.ECF'''. <ref name="TBA.ECF">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1768957912687292874|title=Time to rally the team|date=2024-03-16|author='''TBA.ECF'''}}</ref>
* April 22nd - '''TBA.ECF''' sign [[Dafra1D]] as their coach. <ref name="+Dafra1D">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/C6EhmJVM9Cj/|title=Welcome the newest member of our team!|date=2024-04-22|author='''TBA.ECF'''}}</ref>
* May 13th - '''TBA.ECF''' officially unveil as '''kONO.ECF'''. <ref name="kONO.ECF">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1790025792530911732|title=New round|date=2024-05-13|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* December 1st - '''kONO.ECF''' replace [[Polbandana]] with [[nifee]]. <ref name="-Polbandana">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1863184218190123161|title=As you know, life is about moving forward, and every movement is about change|date=2024-12-01|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref><ref name="+nifee">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1863201251162309008|title=Playing CS with four players is fun, of course, but not nearly as much as playing with a full squad!|date=2024-12-01|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* December 28th - [[kensizor]] is acquired by [[B8]]. <ref name="-kensizor">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1873037880219845015|title=We are forced to announce— kensizor is leaving the team!|date=2024-12-28|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* December 29th -  '''kONO.ECF''' sign [[cptkurtka023]]. <ref name="+cptkurtka023">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1873368709575938445|title=cptkurtka023 — our new player!|date=2024-12-29|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 2nd - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[byr9]]. Additionally, [[nifee]] is acquired by [[TEAM NEXT LEVEL]]. <ref name="-byr9">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1874817996667208032|title=Today, we bid farewell to byr9|date=2025-01-02|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref><ref name="-nifee">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/tnl_cs2/status/1874771449447383260|title=Welcome the new players to the TNL family!|date=2025-01-02|author=[[TEAM NEXT LEVEL]]}}</ref>
* January 23rd - '''kONO.ECF''' sign [[Sijeyy]] and acquire [[zogeN]] from [[TEAM NEXT LEVEL]]. <ref name="+Sijeyy +zogeN">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1882413145744109868|title=zogeN and Sijeyy — now part of kONO.ECF!|date=2025-01-23|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* March 22nd - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[Sijeyy]]. <ref name="-Sijeyy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1903485612956455261|title=Sijeyy is leaving our team|date=2025-03-22|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* April 2nd - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[Dafra1D]]. <ref name="-Dafra1D">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1907416263602700650|title=Our team says goodbye to — Dafra1D|date=2025-04-02|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* June 7th - '''kONO.ECF''' acquire [[OWNER]] from [[Betera Esports]]. <ref name="+OWNER">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/k0n0ecf/1634|title=МИХАЙЛО OWNER ЛИМАР — З НАМИ!|trans_title=MYKHAJLO OWNER LYMAR IS WITH US!|language={{Flag|ua}} Ukrainian|date=2025-06-07|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* June 9th - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[zogeN]]. <ref name="-zogeN">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1932117387177804197|title=ZOGEN LEAVES OUR ROSTER|date=2025-06-09|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* June 12th - '''kONO.ECF''' sign [[Juve]] as coach. <ref name="+juve">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1933222788153675866|title=MEET OUR COACH — JUVE|date=2025-06-12|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* July 15th - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[s4ltovsk1yy]]. <ref name="-s4">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1945106202003738725|title=Today our paths with s4ltovsk1yy part ways|date=2025-07-15|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[amster]]. <ref name="-amster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1954868029910577182|title=Today we say goodbye to amster|date=2025-08-11|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* August 13th - '''kONO.ECF''' bench [[OWNER]], sign [[Burmylov]] and acquire [[birdfromsky]], [[Keoz]], and [[b0RUP]] from [[The Last Resort]]. <ref name="bench owner">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1955570264420601898|title=Today we’re moving OWNER to the bench|date=2025-08-13|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref><ref name="kono.ecf 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/konoecf/status/1955586428227788901|title=We’re opening a brand new chapter in kONO history!|date=2025-08-13|author='''kONO.ECF'''}}</ref>
* August 15th - [[OWNER]] is acquired by [[BASEMENT BOYS]]. <ref name="-owner">{{inside source|source=Satoru Gogym}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 9th - [[cptkurtka023]] is acquired by [[Inner Circle Esports]]. <ref name="-cptkurtka023">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/InCircleEsports/status/2009656462071742489|title=Get ready for the BLAST Bounty|date=2026-01-09|author=[[Inner Circle Esports]]}}</ref>
* January 11th - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[Juve]]. <ref name="-Juve">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/juve_csgo/status/2010119295070593483|title=I'm no longer part of @konoecf|date=2026-01-11|author=[[Juve]]}}</ref>
* March 6th - [[birdfromsky]] and [[b0RUP]] terminate their contracts with '''kONO.ECF''' alleging breaches of contractual obligations by the organization. <ref name="-birdfromsky -b0RUP">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/birdfromsky/status/2029952633788608741|title=As of today, borup and I have not received any payment, and communication from the organization has stopped|date=2026-03-06|author=[[birdfromsky]]}}</ref>
* June 16th - '''kONO.ECF''' part ways with [[Burmylov]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-Burmylov">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Burmylov/status/2066880023450010092|title=LFT|date=2026-06-16|author=[[Burmylov]]}}</ref>
}}

