'''los kogutos''' is an organization-less [[:Category:Poland|Polish]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' team.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2020
|name2=2021
|name3=2022
|name4=2023
|name5=2024
|name6=2025
|name7=2026
|This=7

|content1=
* April 26th - '''los kogutos''' is formed by [[dixyi]], [[tomiko]], [[Enzo]], [[darchevile]], [[maaryy]] and [[rychu1337]], the latter as substitute. <ref name="April 2020">{{inside source|date=2020-04-26|source=tomiko}}</ref>
* August 4th - '''los kogutos''' part ways with [[rychu1337]]. <ref name="-rychu1337">{{inside source|date=2020-08-04|source=tomiko}}</ref>
* August 25th - '''los kogutos''' add [[kRaSnaL]] and move [[dixyi]] to a substitute position. <ref name="+kRaSnaL">{{inside source|date=2020-08-25|source=tomiko}}</ref>
* September 29th - '''los kogutos'''<nowiki>'</nowiki> roster is signed by [[Turów Zgorzelec Esport]]. <ref name="Turów Zgorzelec">{{cite web|url=https://cybersport.pl/270657/pge-turow-zgorzelec-otwiera-sekcje-esportowa-i-przejmuje-sklad-los-kogutos/|date=2020-09-29|title=PGE Turów Zgorzelec otwiera sekcję esportową i przejmuje skład los kogutos|trans_title=PGE Turów Zgorzelec opens the esports section and takes over the los kogutos squad|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|publisher=[[Cybersport.pl]]|author=[[Maciej Petryszyn]]}}</ref>
* December 31st - '''los kogutos''' is re-creacted as [[Turów Zgorzelec Esport]] part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-Turów Zgorzelec">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/PGETurowZgorzelecEsport/posts/147245660492032|date=2020-12-31|title=Na koniec 2020 roku żegnamy się z naszym dotychczasowym składem dywizji CS:GO|trans_title=At the end of 2020, we say goodbye to our current CS:GO squad|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|author=[[Turów Zgorzelec Esport]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* March 6th - '''los kogutos'''<nowiki>'</nowiki> roster is signed by [[Team ESCA Gaming]]. <ref name="ESCA Gaming">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/teamescagaming/status/1368254720230428674|date=2021-03-06|title=Stało się, wchodzimy z buta w scenę Counter Strike'a przejmując tym samym skład Los Kogutos|trans_title=It has happened, we are entering the Counter Strike scene, thus taking over the Los Kogutos line-up|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|author=[[Team ESCA Gaming]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* April 8th - '''los kogutos''' is re-created by [[tomiko]], [[Enzo]], [[darchevile]], [[maaryy]] and [[Nami (Polish player)|Nami]]. <ref name="April 2022">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/maaryyycs/status/1512529794839232515|date=2022-04-08|title=kaguto|author=[[maaryy]]}}</ref>
* April 26th - '''los kogutos''' part ways with [[Nami (Polish player)|Nami]] and add [[mwlky]] as a stand-in. <ref name="-Nami +mwlky">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/mwlkycs/status/1518988260348936193|date=2022-04-26|title=los kogutos mwlky???|author=[[mwlky]]}}</ref>
* May 22nd - '''los kogutos''' part ways with [[mwlky]] and add [[kRaSnaL]]. <ref name="-mwlky +kRaSnaL">{{inside source|date=2022-05-22|source=tomiko}}</ref>
